    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Moran Auctioneers are delighted to bring to the market this three-bedroom, two-bathroom property located in the heart of Ballyvary Village, Co. Mayo.\r\n\r\nThe property offers well-proportioned accommodation over two floors and provides an excellent opportunity for a purchaser to modernise and upgrade the property to their own taste and requirements.\r\n\r\nIdeally positioned within Ballyvary Village, the property is within easy reach of local amenities and services, while Castlebar and the surrounding areas are also readily accessible. The accommodation provides a good balance of living and bedroom space, making this an appealing option for first-time buyers, investors or those seeking a home with scope for improvement."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "The accommodation comprises:\r\n\r\nGround Floor\r\n\r\nSitting Room: 3.65m x 3.91m\r\nKitchen/Dining Room: 4.27m x 5.79m\r\nW.C.: 1.41m x 0.90m\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom: 3.67m x 2.92m\r\nEn-Suite: 0.84m x 2.67m\r\nBedroom 2: 3.88m x 3.59m\r\nBedroom 3: 2.47m x 2.61m\r\nBathroom: 2.67m x 1.74m\r\nHotpress: 0.98m x 1.35m\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended to appreciate the accommodation and potential this property has to offer.\r\n\r\nNOTE: Any information, description, measurement or statement so given or contained in any such sales particulars, webpage, brochure, email, letter, report issued by or on behalf of Moran Auctioneers or the vendor are for illustration purposes only and are not to be taken as matters of fact or to be taken as forming any part of a resulting contract. Moran Auctioneers nor the vendor accept any liability as to their accuracy of the particulars. Interested parties must conduct their due diligence by personal inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of these particulars. No person in the employment of Moran Auctioneers has any authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property."
      },
